<title>SWEDEN: Foreningsbanken posts 24 pct rise in Q1 profit.</title>
<headline>Foreningsbanken posts 24 pct rise in Q1 profit.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish bank Foreningsbanken on Tuesday posted these earnings for the first quarter of the year, ending on March 31.</p>
<p>					     (millions of crowns)</p>
<p> Operating profit			   278  vs 225</p>
<p> Loan losses				  115  vs 173</p>
<p> Net interest income		     *912  vs 841</p>
<p> Commission recievable		     241 vs   190</p>
<p> Commission payable			   15 vs    13</p>
<p> Net result of fin transactions	   44 vs    31</p>
<p> Other operating income		     99 vs   129</p>
<p> Total income				1,214 vs 1,194</p>
<p> Total costs				   746 vs   696</p>
<p> Profit before loan losses		 468 vs   498</p>
<p> Taxes					    78 vs   nil</p>
<p> Net profit				    200 vs   225</p>
<p>--NOTE - Foreningsbanken is set to merge with Swedish bank Swedbank. * Before costs for government debt guarantee.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-70-1017</p>
</text>
